        "title": "Apply the Formula",
        "text": "Using $T_n = a + (n-1)d$ where $a = -4$ and $d = 5$:\n\n$T_n = -4 + (n-1)(5)$\n$T_n = -4 + 5n - 5$\n$T_n = 5n - 9$",
